{"Lua-domination-steal-codes":"Steal Nod cyborg encryption codes.","Lua-domination-yuri-survive":"Yuri must survive.","Lua-domination-tip-yuri-control":"Yuri can mind control up to three enemy units. Mind controlling a fourth will kill the earliest controlled.","Lua-domination-tip-yuri-deploy":"Deploying Yuri releases a mind blast around Yuri and his slaves (the slaves will be unharmed).","Lua-domination-tip-genetic-mutation":"The Genetic Mutation Bomb support power can turn enemy infantry into Brutes under your command. Avoid enemy SAM sites by holding the mouse button when selecting the target, allowing you to control the approach angle.","Lua-domination-destroy-temple":"Locate and destroy the Temple of Nod.","Lua-domination-codes-acquired":"Cyborg encryption codes acquired.","Lua-domination-codes-required":"Encryption codes are required for mission completion.","Lua-domination-escape":"Bring Yuri to the extraction point.","Lua-domination-temple-located":"Temple of Nod located.","Lua-domination-evac-inbound":"Extraction transport inbound.","Lua-domination-keep-yuri-alive":"Keep Yuri alive.","Lua-domination-yuri-respawn":"Yuri has used his tremendous psionic power to cheat death. He will return in 20 seconds.","Lua-domination-thief-respawn":"Yuri has used his tremendous psionic power to save the Thief from death. He will return in 20 seconds."}
